==Finnish==

===Etymology===
*From the same Proto-Uralic root ''[[Appendix:Proto-Uralic root *kole|*kole]]'' as Hungarian [[hal]].

===Intransitive verb===
{{fi-verb|kuol|type=25}}
#to [[die]] (of/from sth = ''[[illative]]''):
#:*[[isoäiti|Isoäiti]][[-ni|ni]] '''kuoli''' [[syöpä]]än.
#:**My grandmother ''died'' of cancer.

